or: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;다 음&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><br style=\"font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif;\"></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;과 정 명:&nbsp;제23기 글로벌 건설 프로젝트 전문가 양성과정</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;교육기 간: 2023. 12. 26(화)&nbsp;∼&nbsp;2024. 2. 7(수), (7주, 231시간)</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">3.&nbsp;장 소:&nbsp;해외건설교육센터</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">4.&nbsp;교육내용</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;◦&nbsp;입문,&nbsp;수주 및 계약관리,&nbsp;금융,&nbsp;공사,&nbsp;플랜트,&nbsp;토목/건축,&nbsp;취업캠프 등</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">5.&nbsp;교육대상:&nbsp;대학교 이상 졸업 또는 졸업예정자(‘24. 9월),&nbsp;구직자,&nbsp;재직자</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;*&nbsp;국민내일배움카드 발급(필수)</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">6.&nbsp;참 가 비:&nbsp;무료</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">7. 접수기간: ~12.13(수)</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">8. 제출서류(필수):&nbsp;졸업(예정)&nbsp;증명서</span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; padding-top: 0px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: -0.36px; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 241); line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;*&nbsp;졸업예정증명서 발급 불가시 성적증명서 및 재학증명서 대체 가능&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
